---
searchExclude: true
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Archive
permalink: /archive/
description: Every volume of the Journal for Law Advocacy, newest first.
---
<header class="pagehead"><div class="wrap">
  <h1>Archive</h1>
  <p>Every volume of the journal, newest first. Each volume is available as its original PDF, and each article has its own page and PDF.</p>
</div></header>

<section><div class="wrap">
  <ul class="vols">
    {%- for i in collections.issues %}
    {%- set n = (collections.articles | inIssue(i.data.volume, i.data.issue)).length %}
    <li><b><a href="{{ i.url }}">{{ i.data.title }}{% if i.data.theme %}: {{ i.data.theme }}{% endif %}</a></b><span class="dots"></span><span class="st">
      {%- if i.data.status == "current" %}Current · {% elif i.data.status == "forthcoming" %}Forthcoming · {% endif -%}
      AY {{ i.data.academic_year }}{% if n %} · {{ n }} {{ "item" if n == 1 else "items" }}{% endif %}</span></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ul>
</div></section>
